==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Silver Tempest|Ariados|4}} from the {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion; both cards have the Pierce attack.
*'''Trap Territory''' is an Ability that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Spidops ex|19}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
*'''Pierce''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Kabuto|39}} and {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Anorith|27}}, both from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Moon}}.

